This product includes protocol tables generated from:

  minecraft-data (https://github.com/PrismarineJS/minecraft-data), MIT licensed
  — packet ids, item, entity and block tables, and collision shapes.

  The Minecraft server's own data-generator output (`--reports`), for data no
  published dataset carries: data component type ids, slot display ids, and the
  block, item and entity registries of versions minecraft-data has not shipped.
  These are registry indices needed to speak the protocol, not game content.

